# Vite only reads env files from the frontend directory — this file must be
# named `.env` (or `.env.local`) inside `chat_frontend/`.
#
# Optional API base URL. Not normally needed: the dev proxy (vite.config.ts)
# and the same-origin production build mean the client talks to its own origin
# (docs/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md Q34). Only set it if you deliberately run the
# frontend and the API on different origins. Currently ignored by the code —
# see gap F2 in docs/GAPS_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/